<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Service Instruction</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        .header-logo { float: right; }
        .content-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .two-column { display: flex; gap: 60px; }
        .column { flex: 1; }
        .list-item { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">SERVICE INSTRUCTION SI/{{ service_instruction_id }}</p>
                <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 10px;">Level 1 certification training for MB3000 and TALYS series (<span data-field="training_code">{{ training_code }}</span>)</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="header-logo">
                <!-- Placeholder for ABB Logo -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <div class="two-column">
                <div class="column">
                    <img src="placeholder_image.jpg" alt="Training image" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">Comprehensive training for distributors and partners required to install, service and support FT-IR analyzer systems.</h2>
                        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Measurement made easy.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <div class="column">
                <div class="content-section">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Profile</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">This course has been designed by {{ employer.name }} to train service engineers who are required to service and support FT-IR analyzer systems after initial commissioning, and who are capable of performing standard MB3000, MB3600, and TALYS commissioning. The training is held at {{ employer.location }}.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Location</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">{{ employer.location }}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Key features</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt;">
                        <li class="list-item">Training duration: <span data-field="training_duration">{{ training_duration }}</span></li>
                        <li class="list-item">Number of participants: Minimum {{ min_participants }}, maximum {{ max_participants }}</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="column">
                <div class="content-section">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Pre-requisites</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt;">
                        <li class="list-item">Service background in instrumentation or similar experience.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Have significant experience with ABB FT-IR analyzers.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Main competencies</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt;">
                        <li class="list-item">Able to understand the principles and concepts of FT-IR technology.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to identify the various models of ABB FT-IR spectrometer platforms and related accessories.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to understand the operation and basic configuration of the FTSW100 process software and Horizon software suite.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to import/export an FTSW100 configuration (.xml) file.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to understand analyzers with new models and/or calibration files.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to acquire calibration development data and report it correctly to the application specialist.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to perform preventive maintenance and service on the main modules of all FT-IR analyzers.</li>
                        <li class="list-item">Able to troubleshoot and correctly report problems to the factory using the standard tools and software.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Certification</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Certification is granted upon successful completion of the exam and is valid for a period of {{ validity_period }} years.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; padding-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="text-align: left;">
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">ABB Inc.</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Process Automation</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Measurement & Analytics</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">{{ contact_address_line_1 }}</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">{{ contact_address_line_2 }}</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Tél: +1-418-877-2944 (other countries)</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Fax: +1-418-877-2634</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Email: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">We reserve the right to make technical changes without prior notice. With regard to purchase orders, the agreed particulars shall prevail.</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">We reserve all rights in this document and in any reproduction, disclosure to third parties or utilization of its contents - in whole or in part - is forbidden without prior written consent of ABB.</p>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">© Copyright {{ current_year }} ABB. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">abb.com/analytical</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>